<TeXmacs|2.1.4>

<style|generic>

<\body>
  <doc-data|<doc-title|Math families and series of the profiled
  fonts>|<doc-subtitle|math roman, math sans serif, math typewriter and bold
  mathematics>>

  Each block sets the text font to the companion the profile declares and the
  math font to the math family. Sans serif and typewriter mathematics must
  come from the <verbatim|sans> and <verbatim|mono> companions of the profile,
  bold mathematics from a real bold math face when the family has one.

  <with|font|Latin Modern Roman|math-font|Latin Modern Math|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>Latin Modern Math: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

  <with|font|NewComputerModern10|math-font|NewComputerModernMath|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>NewComputerModernMath: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

  <with|font|Stix Two Text|math-font|Stix Two Math|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>Stix Two Math: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

  <with|font|Kepler|math-font|KpMath|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>KpMath: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

  <with|font|Fira Sans|math-font|Fira Math|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>Fira Math: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

  <with|font|TeX Gyre Pagella|math-font|TeX Gyre Pagella Math|<\itemize-dot>
    <item>TeX Gyre Pagella Math: <math|a b c+x y z+<big|sum><rsub|k=1><rsup|n>a<rsub|k>>

    <item>sans serif: <math|<with|math-font-family|ms|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>typewriter: <math|<with|math-font-family|mt|a b c+x y z>>

    <item>bold: <math|<with|math-font-series|bold|a b c+x y z+<frac|a+b|c>+<sqrt|x>>>
    </itemize-dot>>

</body>

<initial|<\collection>
<associate|page-medium|paper>
</collection>>
